-- הבהרה לחוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ג/3 (23.1.2023): הסדר לתגמול עובדי הוראה
-- המגישים תלמידים לבחינת בגרות לפי התכנית שברפורמה להתחדשות הלמידה.
-- Clarifies that the humanities-lead role and the ICT coordinator's added
-- role hour, with their budgeting, continue to the end of 2022-23.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in this file is counted in SCHOOL MONTHS of 2022-23 (common.l4's
-- `month number`: September 2022 = 1, August 2023 = 12).
`the end of school year 2022-23` MEANS `month number` August

§ `הבהרה לחוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ג/3`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference number, addressees (owners of upper-division institutions; principals of six-year schools), greeting and subject line; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 The sources: circular תשפ"ג/3 and the letters of the head of the exams division (5.1.2023) and of the chair of the pedagogical secretariat (8.1.2023); the clarification itself is sections 1-2.

DECLARE `continued arrangement` IS ONE OF
    `the humanities-lead role`
    `the ICT coordinator's added role hour`

-- 1: the humanities-lead role (מוביל מח"ר) continues to the end of 2022-23,
-- and so does its budgeting. 2: likewise the ICT coordinator's additional
-- role hour. Months are school months of 2022-23.
@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_2
GIVEN a IS A `continued arrangement`, m IS A NUMBER @desc the school month of 2022-23 (September 2022 = 1)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `continues with its budgeting in` a m IF
    m AT LEAST 1 AND m AT MOST `the end of school year 2022-23`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off, signatories and list of copies; no rule.

#ASSERT `continues with its budgeting in` `the humanities-lead role` 12
#ASSERT `continues with its budgeting in` `the ICT coordinator's added role hour` 6
#ASSERT NOT `continues with its budgeting in` `the humanities-lead role` 13
